.TH LIBMPQ__PATCH_ABORT 3 2026-09-28 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__patch_abort \- discard a staged patch archive
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__patch_abort(mpq_patch_s *patch);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Closes the staged patch writer and removes its unpublished temporary output. The base archive and destination patch path remain unchanged. This call consumes \fIpatch\fP whether it succeeds or fails; callers must not reuse the pointer.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP or a negative libmpq error.
.SH ERRORS
A NULL handle returns LIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST. Close or temporary-file cleanup errors may also propagate.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq__patch_begin (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_begin_mpqe (3),
.BR libmpq__patch_finish (3)
